{"3510450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Are Not Alice", "steam_appid": 3510450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALICE</strong> is a social engineering sandbox game where you play the role of a hacker who has taken over Alice's work computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to spread through her company by talking to her coworkers and convincing them to run a virus file you can send them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about Alice, her coworkers, and her company as you explore this open-world conversational sandbox that changes every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/extras/9cc77feffc2d818451b91f0f5f7204fa.avif?t=1751575842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/extras_big/9cc77feffc2d818451b91f0f5f7204fa.avif?t=1751575842 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you infect each employee's computer, you'll be able to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse their computer files</strong> to learn about them, their job, and their relationships with other employees.<i> Sometimes you'll find a personal file or two, too.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masquerade as others </strong>by using their chat login to talk to their coworkers.<i> Take advantage of their trust by convincing their coworkers to run your virus file.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take over other computers</strong> as you spread throughout the network: every employee has a new story and new connections to infect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own adventure: will you help each employee, or pretend to be them while making things much worse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is this company hiding?</i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALICE</strong> is a social engineering sandbox game where you play the role of a hacker who has taken over Alice's work computer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to spread through her company by talking to her coworkers and convincing them to run a virus file you can send them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about Alice, her coworkers, and her company as you explore this open-world conversational sandbox that changes every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/extras/9cc77feffc2d818451b91f0f5f7204fa.avif?t=1751575842\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510450/extras_big/9cc77feffc2d818451b91f0f5f7204fa.avif?t=1751575842 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you infect each employee's computer, you'll be able to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Browse their computer files</strong> to learn about them, their job, and their relationships with other employees.<i> Sometimes you'll find a personal file or two, too.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masquerade as others </strong>by using their chat login to talk to their coworkers.<i> Take advantage of their trust by convincing their coworkers to run your virus file.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take over other computers</strong> as you spread throughout the network: every employee has a new story and new connections to infect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap